{"seq":3,"slug":"isolate-concurrency","title":"Isolate 并发模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/isolate-concurrency","wordCount":1434,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"isolate-并发模型\">Isolate 并发模型</h1><p>async/await 在单线程事件循环上实现并发——多个任务<strong>交替</strong>执行。但当遇到 CPU 密集型工作（JSON 解析大文件、图像处理、加密哈希）时，单线程会被阻塞，事件循环停转，UI 帧率骤降。Dart 的解决方案是 <strong>Isolate</strong>：一个拥有独立堆内存和事件循环的执行单元，在操作系统层面运行在独立线程上，实现真正的<strong>并行</strong>。2026 年，Dart 团队正在推进 Shared Isolate 计划，为 Isolate 引入受控的共享内存能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先立起本篇的几张底牌，后文所有论证都围绕它们展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Isolate</td>\n<td>独立堆 + 独立事件循环、可真正并行的执行单元</td>\n<td>突破单线程阻塞的根本手段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无共享内存</td>\n<td>Isolate 之间只通过消息传递通信</td>\n<td>消除数据竞争的设计前提</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Isolate.run</code></td>\n<td>一次性计算的高层 API，结果返回后自动销毁</td>\n<td>最简并行方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Isolate.spawn</code></td>\n<td>建立长期双向通道的底层 API</td>\n<td>持续通信与常驻 worker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息成本模型</td>\n<td>复制、转移、共享引用三种传递方式的成本差异</td>\n<td>决定优化方向的性能账本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Isolate Group</td>\n<td>同 Group 共享代码段与编译期常量的优化边界</td>\n<td>解释 spawn 与 spawnUri 的成本差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话串起来：无共享内存消除竞态，Isolate 提供并行执行单元，<code>run</code>/<code>spawn</code> 是两个抽象层级的入口，消息成本模型决定数据该怎么传。</p>\n<h2 id=\"isolate-的架构原理\">Isolate 的架构原理</h2><p>每个 Isolate 拥有自己的堆、自己的事件循环、自己的全局变量副本。Isolate 之间<strong>不共享内存</strong>，只通过消息传递通信：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Dart VM&#10;        subgraph 主 Isolate&#10;            A[堆内存 A] --&gt; B[事件循环 A]&#10;            B --&gt; C[UI 渲染 / 业务逻辑]&#10;        end&#10;        subgraph 工作 Isolate&#10;            D[堆内存 B] --&gt; E[事件循环 B]&#10;            E --&gt; F[CPU 密集计算]&#10;        end&#10;        C --&gt;|SendPort 消息| F&#10;        F --&gt;|SendPort 结果| C&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Dart VM\n        subgraph 主 Isolate\n            A[堆内存 A] --&gt; B[事件循环 A]\n            B --&gt; C[UI 渲染 / 业务逻辑]\n        end\n        subgraph 工作 Isolate\n            D[堆内存 B] --&gt; E[事件循环 B]\n            E --&gt; F[CPU 密集计算]\n        end\n        C --&gt;|SendPort 消息| F\n        F --&gt;|SendPort 结果| C\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>Isolate</th>\n<th>OS 线程</th>\n<th>Green Thread</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存模型</td>\n<td>完全隔离的堆</td>\n<td>共享进程地址空间</td>\n<td>共享堆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信</td>\n<td>消息传递（复制/转移）</td>\n<td>共享变量 + 锁</td>\n<td>共享变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据竞争</td>\n<td>设计上不可能</td>\n<td>需要手动同步</td>\n<td>需要手动同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创建开销</td>\n<td>~1-3ms</td>\n<td>~50-100μs</td>\n<td>~1μs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GC</td>\n<td>独立 GC</td>\n<td>共享 GC</td>\n<td>共享 GC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>CPU 密集并行</td>\n<td>底层系统编程</td>\n<td>高并发 IO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种「无共享」设计消除了数据竞争的可能性——不需要锁、不需要原子操作、不需要内存屏障。代价是跨 Isolate 通信必须序列化数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"isolate-run-最简并行方案\">Isolate.run：最简并行方案</h2><p><code>Isolate.run()</code> 是 Dart 2.19 引入的高层 API，适合一次性计算任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;dart:isolate&#39;;&#10;import &#39;dart:convert&#39;;&#10;import &#39;dart:io&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 在独立 Isolate 中解析大 JSON&#10;Future&lt;List&lt;Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt;&gt;&gt; parseLargeJson(File file) async {&#10;  final text = await file.readAsString(); // IO 在主 Isolate（已是异步）&#10;  return Isolate.run(() {&#10;    // CPU 密集的 jsonDecode 在工作 Isolate 执行&#10;    return (jsonDecode(text) as List).cast&lt;Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt;&gt;();&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:isolate';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:convert';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:io';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在独立 Isolate 中解析大 JSON</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;List&#x3C;Map&#x3C;String, dynamic>>> parseLargeJson(File file) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final text = await file.readAsString(); // IO 在主 Isolate（已是异步）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Isolate.run(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // CPU 密集的 jsonDecode 在工作 Isolate 执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return (jsonDecode(text) as List).cast&#x3C;Map&#x3C;String, dynamic>>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Isolate.run</code> 的生命周期：创建 Isolate → 执行回调 → 返回结果 → 自动销毁。结果通过 <code>Isolate.exit()</code> 优化传递——对于简单类型可以实现零拷贝转移所有权。</p>\n<p>使用约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>传入的函数必须是<strong>顶层函数或静态方法</strong></li>\n<li>闭包捕获的变量会被序列化复制到新 Isolate</li>\n<li>不可发送的对象（Socket、DynamicLibrary、ReceivePort）会触发运行时错误</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"长期运行的工作-isolate\">长期运行的工作 Isolate</h2><p>对于需要双向通信或持续处理任务的场景，使用 <code>Isolate.spawn</code> 建立长期通道：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"class ComputeWorker {&#10;  late final SendPort _workerPort;&#10;  final _receivePort = ReceivePort();&#10;  late final Isolate _isolate;&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;void&gt; start() async {&#10;    _isolate = await Isolate.spawn(&#10;      _workerEntry,&#10;      _receivePort.sendPort,&#10;    );&#10;    // 第一条消息是工作 Isolate 的 SendPort&#10;    _workerPort = await _receivePort.first as SendPort;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;R&gt; compute&lt;R&gt;(dynamic message) async {&#10;    final responsePort = ReceivePort();&#10;    _workerPort.send((message, responsePort.sendPort));&#10;    final result = await responsePort.first;&#10;    responsePort.close();&#10;    if (result is _ErrorWrapper) throw result.error;&#10;    return result as R;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  void dispose() {&#10;    _isolate.kill(priority: Isolate.beforeNextEvent);&#10;    _receivePort.close();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  static void _workerEntry(SendPort mainPort) {&#10;    final workerReceive = ReceivePort();&#10;    mainPort.send(workerReceive.sendPort);&#10;&#10;    workerReceive.listen((message) {&#10;      final (payload, SendPort replyPort) = message as (dynamic, SendPort);&#10;      try {&#10;        final result = _processPayload(payload);&#10;        replyPort.send(result);&#10;      } catch (e) {&#10;        replyPort.send(_ErrorWrapper(e));&#10;      }&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  static dynamic _processPayload(dynamic payload) {&#10;    // 根据消息类型执行不同的计算&#10;    return payload;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class _ErrorWrapper {&#10;  final Object error;&#10;  _ErrorWrapper(this.error);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ComputeWorker {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late final SendPort _workerPort;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final _receivePort = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  late final Isolate _isolate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;void> start() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _isolate = await Isolate.spawn(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      _workerEntry,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      _receivePort.sendPort,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 第一条消息是工作 Isolate 的 SendPort</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _workerPort = await _receivePort.first as SendPort;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;R> compute&#x3C;R>(dynamic message) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final responsePort = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _workerPort.send((message, responsePort.sendPort));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final result = await responsePort.first;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    responsePort.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (result is _ErrorWrapper) throw result.error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return result as R;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void dispose() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _isolate.kill(priority: Isolate.beforeNextEvent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _receivePort.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static void _workerEntry(SendPort mainPort) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final workerReceive = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mainPort.send(workerReceive.sendPort);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    workerReceive.listen((message) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final (payload, SendPort replyPort) = message as (dynamic, SendPort);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        final result = _processPayload(payload);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        replyPort.send(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      } catch (e) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        replyPort.send(_ErrorWrapper(e));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static dynamic _processPayload(dynamic payload) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 根据消息类型执行不同的计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return payload;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class _ErrorWrapper {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final Object error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  _ErrorWrapper(this.error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"消息传递的成本模型\">消息传递的成本模型</h2><p>Isolate 间消息传递的性能取决于数据的类型和大小：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>传递方式</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>null</code>, <code>bool</code>, <code>int</code>, <code>double</code></td>\n<td>直接复制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>String</code></td>\n<td>小字符串复制；大字符串共享只读引用</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>List&lt;int&gt;</code> (TypedData)</td>\n<td>可转移所有权</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（转移）或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（复制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SendPort</code></td>\n<td>跨 Isolate 引用</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义对象</td>\n<td>深度序列化复制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> = 对象图大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译期常量</td>\n<td>共享引用（同一 Isolate Group）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键优化技术：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// TransferableTypedData：零拷贝转移大数据块&#10;Future&lt;Uint8List&gt; processImage(Uint8List pixels) async {&#10;  // 将数据「转移」到工作 Isolate（原 Isolate 不再持有）&#10;  final transferable = TransferableTypedData.fromList([pixels]);&#10;  return Isolate.run(() {&#10;    final data = transferable.materialize().asUint8List();&#10;    return applyFilter(data); // 结果通过 Isolate.exit 零拷贝返回&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// TransferableTypedData：零拷贝转移大数据块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;Uint8List> processImage(Uint8List pixels) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 将数据「转移」到工作 Isolate（原 Isolate 不再持有）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final transferable = TransferableTypedData.fromList([pixels]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Isolate.run(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final data = transferable.materialize().asUint8List();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return applyFilter(data); // 结果通过 Isolate.exit 零拷贝返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"isolate-group-与共享优化\">Isolate Group 与共享优化</h2><p>同一 <code>Isolate.spawn</code> 创建的 Isolate 属于同一个 <strong>Isolate Group</strong>，共享代码段和部分 VM 结构：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>共享层</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>代码段（只读）</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>同 Group 内共享</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>编译期常量</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>同 Group 内共享</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>堆对象</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>完全隔离</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>全局变量</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>各自独立副本</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{共享层} = \\begin{cases} \\text{代码段（只读）} &amp; \\text{同 Group 内共享} \\\\ \\text{编译期常量} &amp; \\text{同 Group 内共享} \\\\ \\text{堆对象} &amp; \\text{完全隔离} \\\\ \\text{全局变量} &amp; \\text{各自独立副本} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">共享层</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.76em;vertical-align:-2.63em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.592em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.45em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">代码段（只读）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">编译期常量</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">堆对象</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全局变量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">同</span><span class=\"mord\"> Group </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内共享</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">同</span><span class=\"mord\"> Group </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内共享</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">完全隔离</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">各自独立副本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着 <code>Isolate.spawn</code> 的创建成本远低于 <code>Isolate.spawnUri</code>（后者需要加载和编译新的代码）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shared-isolate-共享内存的未来\">Shared Isolate：共享内存的未来</h2><p>2026 年 Dart 团队正在推进的 Shared Isolate 计划引入以下能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// @pragma(&#39;vm:shared&#39;) 标记跨 Isolate 共享的静态字段&#10;@pragma(&#39;vm:shared&#39;)&#10;final sharedConfig = AppConfig.load(); // 必须是 final + deeply immutable&#10;&#10;// dart:concurrent 同步原语（计划中）&#10;import &#39;dart:concurrent&#39;;&#10;&#10;@pragma(&#39;vm:shared&#39;)&#10;final mutex = Mutex();&#10;&#10;@pragma(&#39;vm:shared&#39;)&#10;final sharedCounter = AtomicInt64(0);&#10;&#10;// NativeCallable.isolateGroupBound：任意线程回调 Dart&#10;final callable = NativeCallable&lt;Void Function(Int32)&gt;.isolateGroupBound(&#10;  (int value) =&gt; print(&#39;Called from native thread: $value&#39;),&#10;);&#10;// callable.nativeFunction 可传给 C 代码，从任意线程调用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// @pragma('vm:shared') 标记跨 Isolate 共享的静态字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@pragma('vm:shared')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final sharedConfig = AppConfig.load(); // 必须是 final + deeply immutable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// dart:concurrent 同步原语（计划中）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:concurrent';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@pragma('vm:shared')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final mutex = Mutex();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@pragma('vm:shared')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final sharedCounter = AtomicInt64(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// NativeCallable.isolateGroupBound：任意线程回调 Dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final callable = NativeCallable&#x3C;Void Function(Int32)>.isolateGroupBound(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (int value) => print('Called from native thread: $value'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// callable.nativeFunction 可传给 C 代码，从任意线程调用</span></span></code></pre></div><p>共享约束（当前计划）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只有 <code>final</code> 的静态/顶层变量可标记为 <code>@pragma(&#39;vm:shared&#39;)</code></li>\n<li>不能是 <code>late</code></li>\n<li>必须持有 deeply immutable 或 trivially shareable 的值</li>\n<li>支持的类型：String、num、编译期常量、TypedData、Struct</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"何时使用-isolate-vs-async-await\">何时使用 Isolate vs async/await</h2><p>决策框架：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[任务类型?] --&gt; B{CPU 密集?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否:IO 等待| C[使用 async/await]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{耗时超过 16ms?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[留在主 Isolate]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F{一次性还是持续?}&#10;    F --&gt;|一次性| G[Isolate.run]&#10;    F --&gt;|持续通信| H[Isolate.spawn + SendPort]\">graph TD\n    A[任务类型?] --&gt; B{CPU 密集?}\n    B --&gt;|否:IO 等待| C[使用 async/await]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{耗时超过 16ms?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[留在主 Isolate]\n    D --&gt;|是| F{一次性还是持续?}\n    F --&gt;|一次性| G[Isolate.run]\n    F --&gt;|持续通信| H[Isolate.spawn + SendPort]</pre><p>经验法则：如果同步操作超过 16ms（60fps 帧预算），就应该移到 Isolate。典型候选：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON 解析 &gt; 1MB 负载</li>\n<li>图像解码/缩放（纯 Dart 实现）</li>\n<li>加密哈希（SHA-256、BCrypt）</li>\n<li>大文本正则匹配</li>\n<li>数值计算（矩阵乘法、FFT）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Dart 编译到 Web 时的限制：<code>dart2js</code> 和 <code>dart2wasm</code> 没有真正的 Isolate——<code>Isolate.run</code> 退化为在主线程同步执行，<code>compute</code> 也是。Web 平台需要使用 Web Workers 获得并行性，但这不是 <code>dart:isolate</code> API 的一部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Isolate 拥有独立堆与事件循环，跨 Isolate 只传消息，从设计上消除了数据竞争——代价是通信必须序列化。</li>\n<li><code>Isolate.run</code> 适合一次性 CPU 密集任务，创建到销毁全程自动，结果经 <code>Isolate.exit()</code> 可零拷贝返回。</li>\n<li>需要双向或持续通信时用 <code>Isolate.spawn</code> + <code>SendPort</code> 建立长期通道；<code>dispose</code> 里必须 <code>kill</code> 并关闭 ReceivePort。</li>\n<li>消息传递成本随数据类型差异极大：<code>int</code>/<code>SendPort</code> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，自定义对象需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 深拷贝，<code>TransferableTypedData</code> 可零拷贝转移。</li>\n<li>同 <code>Isolate.spawn</code> 的 Isolate 属于同一 Group，共享代码段与编译期常量，因此远便宜于 <code>spawnUri</code>。</li>\n<li>决策法则：IO 等待用 async/await，同步耗时超过 16ms 的 CPU 工作才移到 Isolate；Web 平台没有真 Isolate。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"future-async-await\">Future 与 async/await</a> 理解 Isolate 内部的事件循环如何工作，以及 <a href=\"stream-reactive\">Stream 与响应式编程</a> 了解如何在 Isolate 间传递 Stream 数据管道。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Isolate 并发模型","id":"isolate-并发模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Isolate 的架构原理","id":"isolate-的架构原理"},{"level":2,"text":"Isolate.run：最简并行方案","id":"isolate-run-最简并行方案"},{"level":2,"text":"长期运行的工作 Isolate","id":"长期运行的工作-isolate"},{"level":2,"text":"消息传递的成本模型","id":"消息传递的成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Isolate Group 与共享优化","id":"isolate-group-与共享优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Shared Isolate：共享内存的未来","id":"shared-isolate-共享内存的未来"},{"level":2,"text":"何时使用 Isolate vs async/await","id":"何时使用-isolate-vs-async-await"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Stream 与响应式编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/async-concurrency/stream-reactive"},"next":{"title":"集合与算法库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/collections-algorithms"}}